{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bullet Yeeters - Jetpack Chaos in Your Own Backyard</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for high-flying mayhem where tiny agents with big guns turn your home into a battlefield! Bullet Yeeters is a chaotic third-person shooter with jetpack-powered movement,\u00a0 over-the-top physics, and explosive action in giant household environments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2708\ufe0f <strong>JETPACK COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master aerial movement and outmaneuver your enemies mid-air. Use your jetpack to dodge, strafe, and surprise from above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624020/extras/b4a36748fefe9cf9200c7bdaaef2811e.poster.avif?t=1755849452\" width=616 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624020/extras/b4a36748fefe9cf9200c7bdaaef2811e.webm?t=1755849452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfe0 HOUSEHOLD WARZONES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight in oversized kitchens, garages, living rooms, and more. Everyday objects become tactical cover, traps, or high ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624020/extras/8ae1c642df3b350875997332e4223b27.poster.avif?t=1755849452\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624020/extras/8ae1c642df3b350875997332e4223b27.webm?t=1755849452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd2b</strong> <strong>CUSTOM AGENTS &amp; WILD WEAPONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and personalize agents with unique abilities. Customize jetpacks, gear, and outfits. Choose from a huge arsenal of upgradable guns.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624020/extras/4507f31d90d6776d64c6bdb4c026e7b4.poster.avif?t=1755849452\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624020/extras/4507f31d90d6776d64c6bdb4c026e7b4.webm?t=1755849452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca5 GIANT BOSS FIGHTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take down ridiculous oversized bosses solo or in co-op. Every battle is a spectacle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624020/extras/fb69daf5e6953cccdc3a1d959d522ba3.poster.avif?t=1755849452\" width=616 height=233 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624020/extras/fb69daf5e6953cccdc3a1d959d522ba3.webm?t=1755849452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae PURE MAYHEM, YOUR WAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free-for-All is already available in the game, and other modes \u2014 including Battle Royale, Control Point, and The Floor is Lava \u2014 are coming soon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624020/extras/7da78057d7954f7ddf29d9db5ddb8b60.poster.avif?t=1755849452\" width=616 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624020/extras/7da78057d7954f7ddf29d9db5ddb8b60.webm?t=1755849452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly fast. Shoot hard. Yeet or be yeeted.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3624020?t=1755849452","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3624020?t=1755849452","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624020/5513e139625b7dbcfda32e78edef6e9de598d1df/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755849452","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624020/5513e139625b7dbcfda32e78edef6e9de598d1df/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755849452","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3708040,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bullet Yeeters - Jetpack Chaos in Your Own Backyard</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for high-flying mayhem where tiny agents with big guns turn your home into a battlefield! Bullet Yeeters is a chaotic third-person shooter with jetpack-powered movement,\u00a0 over-the-top physics, and explosive action in giant household environments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2708\ufe0f <strong>JETPACK COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master aerial movement and outmaneuver your enemies mid-air. Use your jetpack to dodge, strafe, and surprise from above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://s