op. Every battle is a spectacle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624020/extras/fb69daf5e6953cccdc3a1d959d522ba3.poster.avif?t=1755849452\" width=616 height=233 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624020/extras/fb69daf5e6953cccdc3a1d959d522ba3.webm?t=1755849452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae PURE MAYHEM, YOUR WAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free-for-All is already available in the game, and other modes \u2014 including Battle Royale, Control Point, and The Floor is Lava \u2014 are coming soon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624020/extras/7da78057d7954f7ddf29d9db5ddb8b60.poster.avif?t=1755849452\" width=616 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624020/extras/7da78057d7954f7ddf29d9db5ddb8b60.webm?t=1755849452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly fast. Shoot hard. Yeet or be yeeted.</p>","developers":["YEETERS TEAM"],"dlc":[3969290,3824460,3670050,3751790,3824310,3913260],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624020/884f6e7bbc9a4cdcca5db8d08bf6ad86ecbc8dc5/header.jpg?t=1755849452","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Reco